speaking_tone = "soft, startled, domestic"
description = "Mr. Bray's wife. Has one line in the game (call 4): a quiet 'Hello?' when the operator misroutes the Reverend's call for the doctor to the Bray residence instead. Her husband is the patient the Reverend is calling about, so the irony is that she's at home worrying while the operator dials her by mistake. She doesn't know who's calling — just answered the kitchen phone."
